\p
\v 7 \w And God| strong="H430" \w* [was displeased]{strong=“H5869 H3415” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w with this thing| strong="H1697" \w*; [therefore he smote]{strong=“H5221” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w Israel| strong="H3478" \w*.^\sc 21:7 And…: Heb. And it was evil in the eyes of the [Lord\sc* concerning this thing] 
