\v 20 \w And David| strong="H1732" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w to Solomon| strong="H8010" \w* \w his son| strong="H1121" \w*, [Be strong]{strong=“H2388” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [and of good courage]{strong=“H553” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [and do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} it: [fear]{strong=“H3372” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [not, nor be dismayed]{strong=“H2865” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}: for the \sc Lord\sc* \w God| strong="H430" \w*, even \w my God| strong="H430" \w*, will be [with thee; he will not fail]{strong=“H7503” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} [thee, nor forsake]{strong=“H5800” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [thee, until thou hast finished]{strong=“H3615” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w all the work| strong="H4399" \w* \w for the service| strong="H5656" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*. 
