\v 8 And they with whom precious \w stones| strong="H68" \w* [were found]{strong=“H4672” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8737”} [gave]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} them \w to the treasure| strong="H214" \w* \w of the house| strong="H1004" \w* of the \sc Lord\sc*, \w by the hand| strong="H3027" \w* \w of Jehiel| strong="H3171" \w* \w the Gershonite| strong="H1649" \w*. 
